# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Double-blind review
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is mirrored by anonymous.4open.science, so anything
# committed here is visible to referees.
#
# CONVENTION: the tracked path CP_PromisingZone_SSR_TypeIError.qmd contains
# the ANONYMIZED manuscript. The with-author source is maintained locally at
# CP_PromisingZone_SSR_TypeIError_author.qmd and is never committed during
# blinded review. R/make_anon.R regenerates the tracked anonymous source.
#
# After acceptance, replace the tracked source with the author version and
# remove this block and the local-only anonymization files.
CP_PromisingZone_SSR_TypeIError_author.qmd

# Legacy generated filename from the earlier anonymization workflow.
CP_PromisingZone_SSR_TypeIError_anon.qmd

# The anonymization script itself names the authors, the organisation and
# the real repository URL in its FORBIDDEN list, so it cannot ship while
# review is blind. Commit it after acceptance.
R/make_anon.R

